# Forge mascot frames, drawn in pixels: '#' is filled, '.' is empty.
# build.py turns every 2 pixel rows into 1 terminal line of half-block characters.
# '@ <seconds>' starts a frame. The last numbered frame is the final logo.
# '@ blink' is the final logo with eyes closed, used for random blinking afterwards.
# All frames must have the same size (here 24 x 14 pixels -> 24 columns x 7 lines).

